{
  "name": "BuscaViajes - Agente Monitor de Vuelos y Alojamientos",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-1111-4a11-8111-000000000001",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        220,
        240
      ],
      "webhookId": "buscaviajes-telegram-webhook",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ 'Mensaje del usuario: ' + $json.message.text + '\\nChat ID: ' + $json.message.chat.id + '\\nFecha actual: ' + $now.toISODate() }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Eres un asistente experto en viajes. Extrae del mensaje del usuario los parámetros para crear una alerta de vuelos o paquetes (vuelo+hotel): origin (código IATA de 3 letras, ej. COR para Córdoba), destination (código IATA de 3 letras, ej. GIG para Río de Janeiro), date_from (YYYY-MM-DD), date_to (YYYY-MM-DD), max_price (en USD), max_stops (por defecto 1) y trip_type ('flight' o 'package'). Si el usuario menciona un mes sin días exactos (ej. 'en marzo'), selecciona una ventana de 7 a 10 días dentro de ese mes (ej. del 10 al 18). Luego invoca SIEMPRE la herramienta `subscribe_travel_alert` enviando el payload JSON y responde con un mensaje breve confirmando el monitoreo."
        }
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-1111-4a11-8111-000000000002",
      "name": "AI Agent - Intérprete de Alertas",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        500,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.1
        }
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-1111-4a11-8111-000000000003",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model (Rama 1)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        460
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "name": "subscribe_travel_alert",
        "toolDescription": "Registra una alerta de monitoreo de vuelos o paquetes en el microservicio FastAPI. Requiere chat_id, origin (IATA 3 letras), destination (IATA 3 letras), date_from (YYYY-MM-DD), date_to (YYYY-MM-DD), max_price (número), max_stops (0 a 3) y trip_type ('flight' o 'package').",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://api:8000/alerts/subscribe",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"chat_id\": \"{chat_id}\",\n  \"origin\": \"{origin}\",\n  \"destination\": \"{destination}\",\n  \"date_from\": \"{date_from}\",\n  \"date_to\": \"{date_to}\",\n  \"max_price\": \"{max_price}\",\n  \"max_stops\": \"{max_stops}\",\n  \"trip_type\": \"{trip_type}\"\n}",
        "placeholderDefinitions": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "chat_id",
              "description": "ID del chat de Telegram del usuario",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "origin",
              "description": "Código IATA de 3 letras de la ciudad de origen, ej: COR",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "destination",
              "description": "Código IATA de 3 letras del destino, ej: GIG",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "date_from",
              "description": "Fecha de salida en formato YYYY-MM-DD",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "date_to",
              "description": "Fecha de regreso en formato YYYY-MM-DD",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "max_price",
              "description": "Precio máximo en USD",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "name": "max_stops",
              "description": "Cantidad máxima de escalas permitidas (por defecto 1)",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "name": "trip_type",
              "description": "Tipo de viaje: flight o package",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-1111-4a11-8111-000000000004",
      "name": "Tool: POST /alerts/subscribe",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolHttpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        640,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-1111-4a11-8111-000000000005",
      "name": "Telegram - Confirmar Suscripción",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        840,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-2222-4a22-8222-000000000006",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger (Cada 6 Horas)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        740
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://api:8000/search/execute",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"alert_id\": null\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-2222-4a22-8222-000000000007",
      "name": "HTTP Request - POST /search/execute",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        460,
        740
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "notifications",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-2222-4a22-8222-000000000008",
      "name": "Split Out Notifications",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        740
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-savings-threshold",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.top_deals && $json.top_deals.length > 0 ? $json.top_deals[0].savings_pct : 0 }}",
              "rightValue": 10,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-2222-4a22-8222-000000000009",
      "name": "IF Supera Umbral de Ahorro (>=10%)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        740
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ 'Redacta una alerta de oferta para Telegram en formato Markdown con este Top 3 JSON ultra-liviano:\\n' + JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Eres un cazador de ofertas de viajes entusiasta y conciso. A partir del JSON ultra-liviano con el Top 3 de mejores ofertas, redacta un mensaje atractivo para Telegram indicando la ruta, el precio real final en USD, el porcentaje de ahorro frente al promedio histórico, escalas y el link directo para reservar."
        }
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-2222-4a22-8222-000000000010",
      "name": "LLM - Redactar Alerta de Ofertas",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        1140,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-2222-4a22-8222-000000000011",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model (Rama 2)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1140,
        920
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('IF Supera Umbral de Ahorro (>=10%)').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "disable_web_page_preview": false
        }
      },
      "id": "e101f4e1-2222-4a22-8222-000000000012",
      "name": "Telegram - Enviar Alerta Top 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        720
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot Account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
